    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about \"rediscovering\" things though. it's more fundamental than that. i don't even recognize the person in the mirror. it feels like the version of me that was worth something has actually died. how am i supposed to just move on and be \"more\" than that when that was the only part of me that mattered? it just feels like a wasted life.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
